<title>HUNGARY: Domus swings to H1 profits.</title>
<headline>Domus swings to H1 profits.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-June 1997  Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating result   3.2 profit  vs    32.7 loss</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax result     8.1 profit  vs    28.2 loss</p>
<p>    Group after-tax result   5.8 profit  vs    28.2 loss</p>
<p>    Group net sales	2,230.0	   vs 1,819.2</p>
<p>    Other revenue	     10.0	   vs    26.0</p>
<p>    Material expend.     1,699.1	   vs 1,347.0</p>
<p>    Personnel expend.	282.0	   vs   281.5</p>
<p>    Depreciation		62.5	   vs    54.6</p>
<p>    Other costs		150.8	   vs   138.8</p>
<p>    Other expend.	     43.0	   vs    55.9</p>
<p>    Net financial income     4.4 profit  vs     5.4 profit</p>
<p>	Financial revenue     16.5	   vs    12.3</p>
<p>	Financial expend.     12.1	   vs     6.9</p>
<p>    Net extraord. income     0.5 profit  vs     1.0 loss</p>
<p>	Extraord. revenue	1.1	   vs     0.6</p>
<p>	Extraord. expend.	0.6	   vs     1.6</p>
<p>    Taxation		     2.3	   vs     0.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Domus Rt is a furniture trading company. The figures unaudited, were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards and are consolidated.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
